      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lakewood_Township%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1943, Aharon Kotler founded Beth Medrash Govoha, establishing Lakewood as a major center of Orthodox Judaism.",
